    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Krashimals</strong> is a fast-paced, chaotic racing game where you and your friends crash, dash, and boost your way to victory! Pick your favorite wacky animal driver, customize your look, and speed through vibrant tracks filled with boost pads, tricky shortcuts, and hidden secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Krashimals!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now featuring <strong>customization</strong>, you can personalize your Krashimal with unique <strong>hats, characters, and vehicles</strong>! Want to race as a <strong>wizard-hat-wearing frog</strong> on a <strong>flying carpet</strong>? Or maybe a <strong>snail rocking a Spartan helmet in a bathtub</strong>? The choice is yours! With fun options like a <strong>traffic cone</strong>, <strong>cardboard box</strong>, and even a <strong>shopping 'kart'</strong>, there\u2019s no shortage of ways to express your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful abilities to outmaneuver your rivals\u2014zip past them with a speed boost, send them flying with a well-timed impact, or find secret paths that give you the ultimate edge. Every race is unpredictable, with creative map designs that reward skill, exploration, and a little bit of mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>\ud83d\ude80 <i>Fast &amp; Fun Racing</i> \u2013 Use boost pads, abilities, and clever shortcuts to speed past your competition.<br>\ud83c\udfc1 <i>Exciting Tracks</i> \u2013 Race across colorful, unique maps filled with surprises and hidden areas.<br>\ud83d\udc3e <i>Crazy Animal Drivers</i> \u2013 Play as a <strong>cat, snail, elephant, frog, or duck</strong>!<br>\ud83c\udfa9 <i>Customize Your Look</i> \u2013 Choose from <strong>hats like a Spartan helmet, wizard hat, or traffic cone</strong>.<br>\ud83d\ude97 <i>Wild Vehicles</i> \u2013 Ride in a <strong>carpet, bathtub, shopping 'kart', or cardboard box</strong>!<br>\u26a1 <i>Abilities &amp; Power-ups</i> \u2013 Master 8 different abilities to gain the upper hand. <br>\ud83c\udf89 <i>Multiplayer Madness</i> \u2013 Compete against friends for the ultimate racing glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to <strong>crash, customize, and compete</strong> in <i>Krashimals</i>! \ud83d\ude80</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a <strong>solo developer</strong>, and I\u2019ve put <i>Krashimals</i> into <strong>Early Access</strong> because I want to keep improving the game with your help! I\u2019m actively working on new features, polish, and content, and <strong>your feedback is incredibly important</strong> in shaping the future of <i>Krashimals</i>. Whether it\u2019s ideas for new maps, customization options, or gameplay tweaks, I\u2019d love to hear from you as the game continues to evolve!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Krashimals</strong> is a fast-paced, chaotic racing game where you and your friends crash, dash, and boost your way to victory! Pick your favorite wacky animal driver, customize your look, and speed through vibrant tracks filled with boost pads, tricky shortcuts, and hidden secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Krashimals!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now featuring <strong>customization</strong>, you can personalize your Krashimal with unique <strong>hats, characters, and vehicles</strong>! Want to race as a <strong>wizard-hat-wearing frog</strong> on a <strong>flying carpet</strong>? Or maybe a <strong>snail rocking a Spartan helmet in a bathtub</strong>? The choice is yours! With fun options like a <strong>traffic cone</strong>, <strong>cardboard box</strong>, and even a <strong>shopping 'kart'</strong>, there\u2019s no shortage of ways to express your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful abilities to outmaneuver your rivals\u2014zip past them with a speed boost, send them flying with a well-timed impact, or find secret paths that give you the ultimate edge. Every race is unpredictable, with creative map designs that reward skill, exploration, and a little bit of mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br>\ud83d\ude80 <i>Fast &amp; Fun Racing</i> \u2013 Use boost pads, abilities, and clever shortcuts to speed past your competition.<br>\ud83c\udfc1 <i>Exciting Tracks</i> \u2013 Race across colorful, unique maps filled with surprises and hidden areas.<br>\ud83d\udc3e <i>Crazy Animal Drivers</i> \u2013 Play as a <strong>cat, snail, elephant, frog, or duck</strong>!<br>\ud83c\udfa9 <i>Customize Your Look</i> \u2013 Choose from <strong>hats like a Spartan helmet, wizard hat, or traffic cone</strong>.<br>\ud83d\ude97 <i>Wild Vehicles</i> \u2013 Ride in a <strong>carpet, bathtub, shopping 'kart', or cardboard box</strong>!<br>\u26a1 <i>Abilities &amp; Power-ups</i> \u2013 Master 8 different abilities to gain the upper hand. <br>\ud83c\udf89 <i>Multiplayer Madness</i> \u2013 Compete against friends for the ultimate racing glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to <strong>crash, customize, and compete</strong> in <i>Krashimals</i>! \ud83d\ude80</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a <strong>solo developer</strong>, and I\u2019ve put <i>Krashimals</i> into <strong>Early Access</strong> because I want to keep improving the game with your help! I\u2019m actively working on new features, polish, and content, and <strong>your feedback is incredibly important</strong> in shaping the future of <i>Krashimals</i>. Whether it\u2019s ideas for new maps, customization options, or gameplay tweaks, I\u2019d love to hear from you as the game continues to evolve!</p>",
    "short_description": "Krashimals is a fast-paced multiplayer kart racing game where up to 4 players race through wacky tracks like Mushy Mountains and Gnome Garden. Collect coins, animal-powered abilities, customize your racer with hats, karts, and wheels, and race to victory in chaotic, fun-filled challenges!",
